<title>NIGERIA: SOCCER-NIGERIA BEAT BURKINA 2-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-NIGERIA BEAT BURKINA 2-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-11-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigeria beat Burkina Faso 2-0</p>
<p>(halftime 0-0) in a group one African World Cup qualifier on</p>
<p>Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorer - Daniel Amokachi (46, 75)</p>
<p>Attendance: 55,000.</p>
</text>
